  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 10 December 2026 at 3:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPositioned above Hobson Bay in Orakei’s prestigious Fenton Circus, Eleven Coates introduces a standalone bespoke residence in one of Auckland’s most coveted addresses. Crafted by Bare Architecture, drawing on over 40 years of architecture and construction experience, this two-level luxury home pairs commanding, panoramic views across the water to the city skyline with an enviable northwest aspect that floods the interiors with natural light.\r\n\r\nDesigned for discerning downsizers and professionals, the 165m² (approx.) floor plan sits on 226m² of freehold land within an exclusive gated enclave, showcasing enduring brick cladding, soaring ceilings up to 2.7 metres, and uncompromising high specifications throughout. At the heart of the home, a designer kitchen anchors the expansive open-plan living zone with a natural stone benchtop, a generous breakfast island, and bespoke Vidaspace oak joinery. Seamless indoor-outdoor flow extends to a sun-drenched, northwest-facing courtyard complete with lush landscaping and an outdoor fireplace, creating an effortless setting for year-round entertaining.\r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises three bedrooms, two fully tiled bathrooms, a guest powder room, and a separate laundry, all finished in premium natural materials. Year-round comfort and security are assured through integrated ducted heating and cooling throughout , high-performance double glazing, upgradeable smart-home technology, and internal access from a single garage.\r\n\r\nBeyond the gates, convenience defines the lifestyle. You are steps from the cafés, shops, and amenities of Coates Avenue Village, a minute from Fenton Circus, and just four minutes from Orakei Marina and Ampersand Eatery, with effortless access to Mission Bay, St Heliers, Parnell, and the CBD.\r\n\r\nTo arrange a private viewing or request further details, contact Carl Watkins at c.watkins@barfoot.co.nz or 021 424 736.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
